    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128475767\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Foreordained</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128475768\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/foreordination?lang=eng\">Foreordination</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475769\" id=\"p1\">not <span class=\"key-word\">sent</span> but unto the lost sheep of … Israel, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/15?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Matt. 15:24</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475770\" id=\"p2\">I go unto him that <span class=\"key-word\">sent</span> me, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/7?lang=eng&amp;id=p33#p33\">John 7:33</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">16:5</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475771\" id=\"p3\">Christ glorified not himself to be <span class=\"key-word\">made</span> an high priest, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Heb. 5:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475772\" id=\"p4\"><span class=\"key-word\">foreordained</span> before the foundation of the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">1 Pet. 1:20</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Rev. 13:8</a>).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475773\" id=\"p5\">he who was <span class=\"key-word\">prepared</span> from the foundation of the world, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/ether/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Ether 3:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475774\" id=\"p6\">my Beloved and <span class=\"key-word\">Chosen</span> from the beginning, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p2#p2\">Moses 4:2</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128475775\" id=\"p7\">Lord said: I will <span class=\"key-word\">send</span> the first, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/abr/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">Abr. 3:27</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128475776\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/gen/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Gen. 3:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/job/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p25#p25\">Job 19:25</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/25?lang=eng&amp;id=p8-p9#p8\">Isa. 25:8–9</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/isa/26?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">26:19</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/hosea/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Hosea 13:14</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">John 1:1</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p5%2Cp24#p5\">17:5, 24</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Mosiah 3:5</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/3-ne/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">3 Ne. 9:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/76?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">D&amp;C 76:13</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/93?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">93:21</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
